    <bpmn:process id="W_W4610" name="W4610. Domestic Remittance Send/Receive Transaction Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer remittance send/receive request
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Remittance transactions across counters
Owner: Counter Staff / Store Ops (VS-07) / AML (VS-86)
Participants: Principal (W4603), Cash Mgmt (VS-08.2), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4610 — Domestic Remittance Send/Receive Transaction Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4610_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4610_Lane1" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4610_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4610_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4610_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4610_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4610_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4610_Start3" name="Customer remittance send/receive request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4610_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4610_Task4" name="Counter Staff process the remittance (sender/receiver KYC W4614, amount…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Counter Staff process the remittance (sender/receiver KYC W4614, amount, destination), apply AML/threshold checks as agent (VS-86/W4619), and confirm via principal (W4603)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / AML
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Counter Lead
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4610_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4610_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4610_Task5" name="Counter Staff collect/disperse cash (send = collect; receive = disperse), issue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Counter Staff collect/disperse cash (send = collect; receive = disperse), issue receipt/reference, and capture to VAS system (W4608)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Cash Mgmt
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4610_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4610_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4610_Task6" name="Counter Staff/AML handle threshold/AML exceptions (W4615/W4619), report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Counter Staff/AML handle threshold/AML exceptions (W4615/W4619), report suspicious transactions (VS-86), and reconcile cash (W4613)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / AML / Cash Mgmt
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Compliance
Duration: Per transaction/daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4610_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4610_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4610_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4610_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4610_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-699 (ensure controlled execution — Counter Operations — Bills Payment, Remittance, E-Money &amp; Mobile Load (PA-156.2).) | - CTL-699: sender/receiver KYC (W4614); AML thresholds/reporting as agent (VS-86/W4619); cash reconciled (SoD)
Owner: Counter Staff / Store Ops (VS-07) / AML (VS-86)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4610_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4610_Annotation8" targetRef="W4610_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
