    <bpmn:process id="W_W4612" name="W4612. Mobile Load/Top-Up Transaction Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer mobile load/top-up request
Frequency: Per transaction (high frequency)
Volume: Load transactions across counters
Owner: Counter Staff / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Telco partner (W4604), Cash Mgmt (VS-08.2), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4612 — Mobile Load/Top-Up Transaction Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4612_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4612_Lane1" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4612_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4612_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4612_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4612_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4612_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4612_Start3" name="Customer mobile load/top-up request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4612_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4612_Task4" name="Counter Staff process the load/top-up (mobile number, amount, telco), confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Counter Staff process the load/top-up (mobile number, amount, telco), confirm via platform (W4604/W4608), and collect cash
Responsible (R): Counter Staff
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Counter Lead
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4612_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4612_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4612_Task5" name="Counter Staff issue receipt, capture the transaction (commission accrual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Counter Staff issue receipt, capture the transaction (commission accrual W4617), and handle any platform failure/exception (W4615)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Finance
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4612_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4612_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4612_Task6" name="Counter Staff/Cash Mgmt reconcile load cash at end-of-day (W4613), and Finance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Counter Staff/Cash Mgmt reconcile load cash at end-of-day (W4613), and Finance settles commission with telco (W4617)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Cash Mgmt / Finance
Accountable (A): Store Manager / CFO
Duration: Per transaction/daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4612_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4612_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4612_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4612_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4612_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-699 (ensure controlled execution — Counter Operations — Bills Payment, Remittance, E-Money &amp; Mobile Load (PA-156.2).) | - CTL-699: load confirmed before cash collected; receipt issued (VS-79); commission reconciled (W4617); cash reconciled (SoD)
Owner: Counter Staff / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
