    <bpmn:process id="W_W4616" name="W4616. VAS Customer Service, Complaints &amp; Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer query/complaint; disclosure requirement
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: VAS customer service across counters
Owner: Customer Support (VS-13) / Store Ops (VS-07) / Compliance (VS-22)
Participants: Principals (W4602–W4604), Legal (VS-100.3), Marketing (VS-14)
Source: workflow W4616 — VAS Customer Service, Complaints &amp; Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4616_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4616_Lane1" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4616_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4616_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4616_Lane2" name="Customer Support">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4616_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4616_Lane3" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4616_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4616_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4616_Start5" name="Customer query/complaint; disclosure requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4616_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4616_Task6" name="Counter Staff/Customer Support provide VAS customer service (transaction…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Counter Staff/Customer Support provide VAS customer service (transaction status, fees, receipt), with clear fee/commission disclosure (BSP consumer protection VS-22)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Customer Support
Accountable (A): Store Manager / CX Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4616_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4616_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4616_Task7" name="Customer Support/Compliance manage complaints (failed posting, dispute, fee)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Support/Compliance manage complaints (failed posting, dispute, fee), routing principal-specific to principals, and resolving per SLA (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Customer Support / Compliance / Principals
Accountable (A): CX Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Per complaint</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4616_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4616_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4616_Task8" name="Compliance/Legal ensure disclosure compliance (fees, agent-not-principal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal ensure disclosure compliance (fees, agent-not-principal, consumer rights RA 7394/BSP), manage escalations, and report complaint trends (VS-22)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4616_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4616_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4616_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4616_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4616_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-699 (ensure controlled execution — Counter Operations — Bills Payment, Remittance, E-Money &amp; Mobile Load (PA-156.2).) | - CTL-699: fees/commission disclosed (BSP VS-22); agent-not-principal made clear; complaints managed per SLA (VS-13)
Owner: Customer Support (VS-13) / Store Ops (VS-07) / Compliance (VS-22)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
